  ],
  "description": "Engaged LM308 silicon-clipping circuit transcribed from Dirk Hendrik RATS.UTSCH, revision P, 6 January 2006. The LM308 device approximates the 30 pF-compensated amplifier internally. The 1N4007 card represents the 1N4001 supply diode. The op-amps use 1.5 V nominal headroom from both ends of the 9 V supply.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
